  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China HCFC Phase-Out Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to reduce HCFC production and HCFC-141b consumption in the polyurethane (PU) foam sector in order to contribute to the Government of China&apos;s endeavor to comply with its Montreal Protocol phase-out obligations for HCFCs by 2015,as well as to reduce emissions of GHG from the production and PU foam sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
